sequenceDiagram
  participant C as API client
  participant CP as Control plane (system cell)
  participant R as Registry and CDN
  participant K as Kernel (native ABI)
  participant L as Container cell
  C->>CP: PullImage(name@digest, extra layers)
  CP->>R: DNS, TCP, TLS, HTTP: token, manifest, blobs
  R-->>CP: layers, each checked against its sha256
  CP->>CP: gunzip, tar, whiteouts: one Ichor image
  CP->>K: IMAGE_CREATE (root hash checked)
  C->>CP: CreateCell(image, memory)
  CP->>K: CELL_CREATE (account, address, /etc/hosts)
  C->>CP: Run(argv, env)
  CP->>K: CELL_SPAWN
  K->>L: execve in the cell's overlay root
  L-->>CP: stdout and stderr (PROCESS_READ)
  CP-->>C: RunEvent stream, then the exit status
